ALL ABOUT THE ADVOCACY:
Developed a tourism advocacy campaign showcasing the beauty, cultural heritage, 
and tourism potential of Tawi-Tawi. The campaign highlights its islands, tourist destinations, 
local communities and tribes, festivals, accommodations, and the annual Kamardikaan sin Tawi-Tawi celebration. 
It aims to promote responsible tourism, preserve cultural identity, and encourage more people to discover and 
appreciate the hidden treasures of Tawi-Tawi.
